  "suite": "split_shares",
  "description": "Integer split shares at 1e6 = 100% (0xSplits PERCENTAGE_SCALE). percent() parses a decimal percentage with at most 4 decimals into ppm. ovm_split_params turns reward (and optional principal) recipients into the exact SplitV2 parameters the SDK creates: reward shares must sum to 990000 and the chain RAF recipient is added with 10000; for kind \"total\" without principal recipients, each reward recipient gets its reward share plus floor(10000 / n), and 10000 mod n goes to the first recipient in ascending numeric address order (\"Split Everything\"). Recipients are output in ascending numeric address order.",
